        <p>Hair goes through a lot, from heat styling and everyday stress to the natural effects of time. Most hair products focus on the strands, but fuller-looking hair starts with the scalp.</p>
        <p>The Hair Renewal Serum is built around pea sprout extract, peptides and niacinamide to help target the look of thinning, support the appearance of denser, fuller-looking hair and keep the scalp hydrated.</p>
